Package: graft
Title: Reviewed Project Memory and Persistent Artifacts
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("James", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "github@jameshwade.com")
Description: Saves immutable artifacts, exact dependency selections, and
    explicit host review decisions so R applications and AI agents can recall
    reviewed project knowledge across conversations and workflows. Also
    publishes shared concepts and relationships bound to pinned data-dict
    dictionaries. Applications own authentication, authorization, and approval
    policy.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
